  "notes": [
    "Accent is a single hue (#3f7fd0) on every hairline — a recolour is a find/replace on that value.",
    "type-overlay.svg carries the card type \"MODEL\" as baked text rotated -90° (reads bottom-to-top from the bottom-left corner, ending just below the icon rail). Text colour #f4f9fc for contrast on the accent bar.",
    "collector.svg bakes the set mark glyph and the year 2026 (right-aligned); the card number is live text — textBoxes.collector, format NNN/TTT, right-aligned.",
    "traits are live text in textBoxes.traits: 1–5 words, uppercase, joined with \" · \" (maxWords 5). The box is inset to the clear run BETWEEN the subtitle plate's baked diamond pips — never widen it. Long strings shrink to fit (autoFit.minSize 14).",
    "Layer files are cropped to their own artwork; composite each at its x/y on the 825×1125 canvas.",
    "aperture-mask.svg (where present) is a solid black octagon in the art box — clip artwork with it, then composite art-window.svg above.",
    "guides.svg is non-printing (id=guides, data-printing=false).",
    "Slot centres are true geometric centres (x.5 values are intentional)."
  ]
}
